load @term/seed/group
  find group

# The unitary group: the complex linear maps preserving a Hermitian inner product, the length-preserving symmetries of
# complex vector space, the rotations of quantum state space. U(1) is the circle, the phase of a quantum amplitude.
# Its determinant-one subgroup is the special unitary group, the gauge groups of the weak and strong forces. The form
# carries the underlying group; preserving the Hermitian inner product is the defining condition.
form unitary-group
  link group, like group
